---
// src/pages/the-pleromic-extraction.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="The Pleromic Extraction: The Divine Source Code"
  description="Four actionable esoteric blueprints to manually tune the biological antenna, overcome the Babel software wipe, and override the Demiurgic grid."
  article={true}
>
  <div class="site-wrapper section theme-void" style="padding-top: 20px; padding-bottom: 80px;">

    <!-- Wayfinding Breadcrumb Conduit -->
    <nav class="anu-wayfinding-conduit" aria-label="Hub Navigation">
      <ul class="breadcrumb-trail">
        <li><a href="/">↵ Anuhazi Root</a></li>
        <li class="separator" aria-hidden="true">/</li>
        <li class="current-node" aria-current="page">The Pleromic Extraction</li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hub Hero Header -->
    <header class="anu-hub-hero reveal">
      <span class="anu-eyebrow eyebrow-silver">Acoustic Cybernetics &amp; Somatic Alchemy</span>
      <h1 class="hero-title-large">The Divine Source Code</h1>
      <p class="hero-description-wide">
        The Babel software wipe scrambled the Pleromic machine-code, locking the human hardware into dense, thermodynamic loops of entropy. Below are the unburied blueprints: four highly specific, actionable esoteric mechanics required to manually tune the biological antenna and override the Demiurgic grid.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content Body -->
    <section class="anu-hub-body">

      <!-- Source Code 01 -->
      <article class="reveal reveal-delay-1 anu-extract-card">
        <div class="anu-extract-badge">Source Code 01</div>
        <h2 class="extract-card-title">The Nirioonossian Acoustic Matrix</h2>
        
        <div class="anu-extract-grid">
          <div class="grid-section">
            <strong class="label-silver">Pleromic Function:</strong>
            <p class="text-silver">The fundamental unit of cosmic vibration. The exact frequency standard by which the Universal Mind (Theomertmalogos) maintains vivifyingness. It governs the macrocosmic acoustic physics where sound-vibrations generate corresponding geometric and electromagnetic realities.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid-section">
            <strong class="label-copper">Archontic Encryption:</strong>
            <p class="text-silver">The installation of a hardware suppressor (the Organ Kundabuffer) degraded the human auditory receivers. This locked the Bio-Computer into the "Babel" of random, mechanical noise, severing resonance with the Nirioonossian standard.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid-section highlight-box">
            <strong class="label-gold">The Acoustic Operation:</strong>
            <p class="text-parchment">Execute the acoustic permutation algorithms of the <em>Sepher Yetzirah</em>. Chain the 22 root acoustic frequencies in a rigid combinatorial matrix (e.g., <em>"Aleph with all, and all with Aleph"</em>). Continuous, unbroken chanting generates an internal scalar wave that overrides the Kundabuffer's frequency jam, constructing an astral vehicle out of pure resonance.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Source Code 02 -->
      <article class="reveal reveal-delay-2 anu-extract-card">
        <div class="anu-extract-badge">Source Code 02</div>
        <h2 class="extract-card-title">Kesdjan Routing &amp; Hanbledzoin</h2>
        
        <div class="anu-extract-grid">
          <div class="grid-section">
            <strong class="label-silver">Pleromic Function:</strong>
            <p class="text-silver">The 3-centered apparatus (Head, Spine, Solar Plexus) was engineered to transmute raw cosmic elements into high-voltage energy. This energy coats and perfects the immortal Kesdjan (Astral) body. Its vital fluid is the energetic substance known as Hanbledzoin.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid-section">
            <strong class="label-copper">Archontic Encryption:</strong>
            <p class="text-silver">The Demiurge established abnormal conditions of existence, starving the system of Hanbledzoin. Energy is hijacked purely for biological survival and mechanical reproduction (exioëhary), allowing the entropic gravity of the spinal marrow to overwhelm the synthesizing solar plexus.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid-section highlight-box">
            <strong class="label-gold">The Somatic Operation:</strong>
            <p class="text-parchment">Execute <em>Aiësiritoorassian contemplation</em>. Extract Hanbledzoin from the "second being-food" (air) via hyper-conscious, rhythmic respiration. Manually route this scalar energy down the spine to the solar plexus. Apply the shock of intentional suffering (<em>being-partkdolgduty</em>) against mechanical urges to synthesize the forces and crystallize the immortal hardware.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Source Code 03 -->
      <article class="reveal reveal-delay-2 anu-extract-card">
        <div class="anu-extract-badge">Source Code 03</div>
        <h2 class="extract-card-title">The 42-Scalar Unlocking Sequence</h2>
        
        <div class="anu-extract-grid">
          <div class="grid-section">
            <strong class="label-silver">Pleromic Function:</strong>
            <p class="text-silver">At cosmogenesis (<em>Beresheet</em>), six spatial and energetic dimensions were compacted into a single focal point (Zeir Anpin) to ignite the universe. These are the structural locks of the ten multidimensional spheres.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid-section">
            <strong class="label-copper">Archontic Encryption:</strong>
            <p class="text-silver">The Archons locked human consciousness into the lowest density (Malkuth/Earth), suppressing epigenetic memory of the higher six dimensions. This traps the Bio-Computer in a localized simulation of rigid chronological time and mechanical Fate.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid-section highlight-box">
            <strong class="label-gold">The Somatic Operation:</strong>
            <p class="text-parchment">Deploy the 42-letter matrix (the <em>Ana B'koach</em> cipher). This scalar-wave sequence interfaces directly with the compacted dimensions. Mentally scan and vibrate the specific strings to act as a decryption key, amplifying internal voltage and unlocking the six dormant dimensions within your own Central Column.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Source Code 04 -->
      <article class="reveal reveal-delay-3 anu-extract-card spacing-bottom-large">
        <div class="anu-extract-badge">Source Code 04</div>
        <h2 class="extract-card-title">Aeonic Firewall Bypass Ciphers</h2>
        
        <div class="anu-extract-grid">
          <div class="grid-section">
            <strong class="label-silver">Pleromic Function:</strong>
            <p class="text-silver">In the uncorrupted state, ascending consciousness flows freely through the macrocosmic grid (the Aeons and Firmaments) to return to the Treasury of Light.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid-section">
            <strong class="label-copper">Archontic Encryption:</strong>
            <p class="text-silver">Hostile gatekeepers (Archons) were installed at each aeonic threshold as thermodynamic firewalls. Uninitiated hardware lacking the correct subroutines is incinerated and recycled back into mechanical rebirth (Samsara).</p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid-section highlight-box">
            <strong class="label-gold">The Acoustic/Somatic Operation:</strong>
            <p class="text-parchment">To achieve Escape Velocity, deploy the numeric ciphers from the deep-mind archive (<em>Books of Jeu</em>) as brute-force cybernetic overrides. Execute the internal seal and project the vibratory command. <br /><br />
            • <strong>8th Aeon:</strong> Cipher <code class="code-highlight">8054</code> — <em>"Withdraw yourselves..."</em><br />
            • <strong>10th Aeon:</strong> Cipher <code class="code-highlight">4559</code> + corresponding seal.<br />
            • <strong>12th Aeon:</strong> Cipher <code class="code-highlight">9885</code> to draw back the veils. <br /><br />
            These commands force the wardens to withdraw to the left, granting unhindered vertical transit.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <hr class="anu-divider central-divider reveal" aria-hidden="true" />

      <!-- The Prime Directive -->
      <aside class="anu-terminal terminal-prime-directive reveal reveal-delay-3" aria-labelledby="terminal-heading">
        <h2 id="terminal-heading">The Prime Directive</h2>
        <p>
          The map is not the territory. The data has been unburied, but theoretical comprehension is merely the exhaust of the machine. The extracted codes are utterly useless unless synthesized through ruthless somatic execution. <strong>Solve et Coagula.</strong>
        </p>
      </aside>

    </section>

  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero-title-large {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.8rem);
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .anu-hub-body {
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 40px auto 0;
  }

  .anu-extract-card {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--anu-void-card, #09101d);
    border: 1px solid var(--anu-border, rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.25));
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 36px 32px 32px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }

  .anu-extract-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: -12px;
    left: 24px;
    background: var(--anu-void, #050a12);
    border: 1px solid var(--anu-gold, #c5a059);
    color: var(--anu-gold, #c5a059);
    padding: 2px 12px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-family: var(--font-heading, 'Cinzel', serif);
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .extract-card-title {
    color: var(--anu-gold, #c5a059);
    font-family: var(--font-heading, 'Cinzel', serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.5vw, 1.85rem);
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .anu-extract-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .grid-section strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-heading, 'Cinzel', serif);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .label-silver {
    color: var(--anu-silver, #a8b2c1);
  }

  .label-copper {
    color: var(--anu-copper, #c87d55);
  }

  .label-gold {
    color: var(--anu-gold, #c5a059);
  }

  .text-silver {
    color: var(--anu-silver, #a8b2c1);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .text-parchment {
    color: var(--anu-parchment, #e6ded0);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .highlight-box {
    background: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.05);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--anu-gold, #c5a059);
    padding: 16px 20px;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .code-highlight {
    background: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.15);
    color: var(--anu-gold, #c5a059);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    font-size: 0.9em;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .spacing-bottom-large {
    margin-bottom: 50px;
  }

  .terminal-prime-directive {
    margin-top: 50px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .terminal-prime-directive h2 {
    color: var(--anu-gold, #c5a059);
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .anu-extract-card {
      padding: 40px 40px 36px;
    }
  }
</style>